{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 3, "text": ".ﻮﺘﻠﻟ ﻱﺭﺍﻮﺠﺑ ﺖﻨﻛ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 5, "text": ".ﻦﻛﺃ ﻢﻟ ،ﻻ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 6, "text": ".ﺓﺁﺮﻤﻟﺍ ﻡﺎﻣﺃ ﺖﻧﺍ ﺕﺪﻤﺠﺗ"}
