{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 338, "text": ".ﺔﻳﺬﺣﻷﺍ ﺾﻌﺑ ﻰﻠﻋ ﻝﻮﺼﺤﻟﺍ ﻲﻓ ﻙﺪﻋﺎﺳﺄﺳ ،ﻝﺎﺣ ﺔﻳﺃ ﻰﻠﻋ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 339, "text": ".ﻥﻵﺍ ﺲﻴﻟ ﻦﻜﻟﻭ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 340, "text": ".ﻙﺪﻋﻭﺇ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 341, "text": ""}
